<article class="env-definition" id="05S2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05S2">Definition <span data-tag="05S2">13.13.5</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{A}$ be an abelian category. Let $\text{FAc}(\mathcal{A})$ and $\text{FQis}(\mathcal{A})$ be as in Lemma <a href="/tag/05S1" data-tag="05S1">13.13.4</a>. The <em>filtered derived category of $\mathcal{A}$</em> is the triangulated category </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  DF(\mathcal{A}) = K(\text{Fil}^ f(\mathcal{A}))/\text{FAc}(\mathcal{A}) = \text{FQis}(\mathcal{A})^{-1} K(\text{Fil}^ f(\mathcal{A})).  \]
</div>
</article>